tabs: File [Write] Edit Production Collaboration View
## Element
  S Scene Heading mark=. name=Scene Heading (Ctrl+1)
  S Action mark=! name=Action (Ctrl+2)
  S Character mark=@ name=Character (Ctrl+3)
  S Parenthetical mark=() name=Parenthetical (Ctrl+4)
  S Dialogue mark=“ name=Dialogue (Ctrl+5)
  S Transition mark=> name=Transition (Ctrl+6)
  S Centered mark=>< name=Centered (Ctrl+7)
  S Lyrics mark=~ name=Lyrics (Ctrl+8)
## Scene
  L INT./EXT. icon=foreground_home.svg name=Inside or Outside…
  L Character icon=foreground_account.svg name=Character Name…
  L Color icon=foreground_color-palette.svg name=Scene or Section Color… (Ctrl+Shift+L)
## Emphasis
  T Bold icon=foreground_bold.svg name=Bold (Ctrl+B)
  T Italic icon=foreground_italic.svg name=Italic (Ctrl+I)
  T Underline icon=foreground_underline.svg name=Underline (Ctrl+U)
  S Right to Left icon=foreground_rtl.svg name=Right to Left Line
## Script
  select Script format
  S Title Page icon=foreground_document.svg name=Title Page… (Ctrl+Shift+T)
  S Montage icon=foreground_insert-block.svg name=Montage
  S Intercut icon=foreground_insert-block.svg name=Intercut
  S Flashback icon=foreground_insert-block.svg name=Flashback
  S Super icon=foreground_insert-block.svg name=Super
